\newlabel{fig:rf_15_taxon_methods}{{5}{12}{\textbf {Results on 15-taxon dataset.} (a)-(b) Average RF rates of ASTRAL, wQFM, and wQFM+QT-WEAVER on varying model conditions with varying sequence lengths and numbers of genes. (c)-(d) Average Jensen-Shannon divergence for the uncorrected and corrected quartet distributions}{figure.caption.8}{}}
